@startuml
title Activity 14 - Supplier Invoice Submission

|Supplier|
start
:Open completed GRN;
:Choose Create Invoice;
:Review PO, GRN and supplier details;
:Enter invoice number and invoice date;
:Enter amount, tax and currency;
:Attach invoice PDF or image;
|Frontend|
:Validate invoice fields and attachment;
if (Invoice valid?) then (yes)
  :POST /api/supplier-finance/invoices;
  |Backend|
  :Verify supplier owns completed GRN;
  :Check invoice number uniqueness;
  if (GRN and invoice checks pass?) then (yes)
    :Set invoice status = PENDING_APPROVAL;
    :Persist protected finance record;
    :Notify Treasury/Finance Officer;
    :Send approval email;
    |Supplier|
    :See invoice submitted;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Return conflict or eligibility error;
    |Frontend|
    :Show invoice error;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Show missing field or attachment error;
  stop
endif
@enduml
